      }) with { supersedes = { "01a19c28-fbe6-72f4-ae88-b6d4f0d9b2e4"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-ae43-72dc-95af-58f8a31bf9c3"
      "The exam refuses 16 file sets. Each removes one declaration from a synthetic file set, and the refusal must name it. An example that another pattern also matched would be accepted, and the exam would not run."
      "Plan the Zenoh service component crate and its registration"
